{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How hard can it be to retire on a dying planet? The future has been torn to shreds by those who hold it in their hydraulic claws.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scropia is a story-driven visual novel set on a planet colonized by mechanical life forms, featuring mini-games. This civilization, which briefly introduces itself as the Federation and rules nearly the entire planet with an iron fist, is rapidly approaching its end due to never-ending wars with biological life forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scropia's story begins when the bot named Mether wakes up while being transported to a place called \u201cparadise\u201d for retirees via a kind of cable car line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will shape your destiny.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036720/extras/f4a4d2303633a80c5e72ea937bef9168.avif?t=1773161363\" alt=\"\"width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  <br><strong>Game Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Interaction: You must make vital choices in difficult situations and pass the interrogations of both government officials and rebels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Puzzles: There are many secrets about the characters and the universe. It is your task to find and solve them.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Mini-Games and Extras: This game offers mini-games, extra content, and alternative endings for players seeking variety.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHARACTERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u25c6 Characters who generally appear friendly and mostly possess a single personality had managed to develop their own unique personalities...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4036720?t=1773161363","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036720/fff117cb1f201f889c12f1bcba6cfe01ad7b8ae4/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1773161363","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036720/9553eb7a8b7a46edb014ab0540d01fdbe4e1a630/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773161363","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4036720/9553eb7a8b7a46edb014ab0540d01fdbe4e1a630/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773161363","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","demos":[{"appid":4037810,"description":""}],"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How hard can it be to retire on a dying planet? The future has been torn to shreds by those who hold it in their hydraulic claws.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scropia is a story-driven visual novel set on a planet colonized by mechanical life forms, featuring mini-games. This civilization, which briefly introduces itself as the Federation and rules nearly the entire planet with an iron fist, is rapidly approaching its end due to never-ending wars with biological life forms.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scropia's story begins when the bot named Mether wakes up while being transported to a place called \u201cparadise\u201d for retirees via a kind of cable car line.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your choices will shape your destiny.</p><p clas